  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Gender and digitalization across context</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender and digitalisation across context (GENDIG): enhancing the understanding and application of gender studies for sustainable quality higher education and community development in Uganda and Tanzania. Digitalisation of master courses in gender studies will be a central intervention in the project, accompanied by research on the effect this might have on inclusion and quality in higher education and the larger society.</narrative>
  </description>
